#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:2
msgid "Preferences and Maintenance"
msgstr "偏好设置与维护"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Settings window also includes preferences that shape how Studio feels"
" and how it keeps your workspace organized."
msgstr "设置窗口还包含影响 Studio 使用感受以及工作区组织方式的偏好。"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:8
msgid "General"
msgstr "常规"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:10
msgid ""
"Use **Settings > General** for language and general Studio behavior. "
"These preferences affect Studio's local behavior; they do not rewrite "
"your Godot project."
msgstr ""
"使用 **Settings > General** 配置语言和 Studio 常规行为。这些偏好影响 Studio 的本地行为，不会重写 "
"Godot 项目。"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:14
msgid "General settings include:"
msgstr "常规设置包括："

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:16
msgid "the display language, with a system-default option;"
msgstr "显示语言，并可选择跟随系统默认设置；"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:17
msgid "a system notification when a background AI reply finishes;"
msgstr "后台 AI 回复完成时显示系统通知；"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:18
msgid "automatic compaction of older session activity details;"
msgstr "自动精简旧会话活动详情；"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:19
msgid "next-step suggestions in the empty composer;"
msgstr "在空 Composer 中显示下一步建议；"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:20
msgid "automatic update checks; and"
msgstr "自动检查更新；以及"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:21
msgid "minimizing Studio to the system tray when the window closes."
msgstr "窗口关闭时将 Studio 最小化到系统托盘。"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:23
msgid ""
"Theme controls and the global Godot executable are no longer on this "
"page. Use **Settings > Appearance** for the former and **Settings > "
"Development environments** for the latter."
msgstr ""
"主题控制和全局 Godot 可执行文件已不再位于此页面。前者请使用 **Settings > Appearance**，后者请使用 "
"**Settings > Development environments**。"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:28
msgid "Automatic history compaction"
msgstr "自动精简历史活动详情"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:30
msgid ""
"The **Automatically compact older session activity details** switch is "
"enabled by default. Studio keeps full details for the 10 most recent "
"completed user rounds. Older thinking, tool arguments, and tool output "
"are permanently removed from the stored activity details, while tool "
"status, approval results, and key summaries remain."
msgstr "**自动精简旧会话活动详情** 开关默认开启。Studio 会保留最近 10 轮已完成用户轮次的完整详情。更早的 thinking、工具参数和工具输出会从已存储的活动详情中永久移除，但工具状态、审批结果和关键摘要会保留。"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:36
msgid ""
"Compaction runs in the background for completed session activity. Turning"
" the switch off stops future compaction, but it does not restore history "
"that has already been compacted."
msgstr "精简会在后台处理已完成的会话活动。关闭开关会停止未来的精简，但不会恢复已经精简的历史内容。"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:41
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "外观"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:43
msgid ""
"Use **Settings > Appearance** to control the application theme mode, "
"accent color, dynamic effects, UI font size, body font, code font, and "
"code font size. These options change how Studio is presented without "
"changing the project. If text is hard to read, change the font size "
"rather than adding formatting instructions to every request."
msgstr ""
"使用 **Settings > Appearance** 控制应用主题模式、强调色、动态效果、UI "
"字体大小、正文和代码字体以及代码字体大小。这些选项只改变 Studio "
"的呈现方式，不会改变项目。文字难以阅读时，请调整字体大小，而不是在每个请求中添加格式要求。"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:50
msgid "Keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "键盘快捷键"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:52
msgid ""
"Open **Keyboard shortcuts** to search the available actions and replace a"
" binding. Studio checks for conflicts and requires a modifier for "
"printable keys. The default Windows bindings are listed in "
":doc:`../reference/shortcuts`."
msgstr ""
"打开 **Keyboard shortcuts** 搜索可用操作并替换快捷键绑定。Studio 会检查冲突，并要求可打印按键使用修饰键。默认 "
"Windows 绑定列在 :doc:`../reference/shortcuts` 中。"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:58
msgid "Personalization"
msgstr "个性化"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:60
msgid ""
"The **Personalization** page lets you adjust user, Git commit, and "
"command review prompts. Keep instructions specific and avoid putting "
"secrets or instructions that would weaken review into these fields."
msgstr ""
"**Personalization** 页面允许你调整用户提示词、Git 提交提示词和命令审查提示词。请保持指令具体，不要在这些字段中放入 "
"secret 或会削弱审查的指令。"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:64
msgid ""
"The Git commit prompt affects the optional commit-message model. The "
"command review prompt affects how free terminal commands are reviewed in "
"Auto-safe mode. Keep these prompts short and specific; they guide review "
"but do not replace the tool policy."
msgstr ""
"Git 提交提示词会影响可选的提交消息模型。命令审查提示词会影响 Auto-safe "
"模式下如何审查自由终端命令。请保持这些提示词简短具体；它们可以引导审查，但不能替代工具策略。"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:69
msgid ""
"The general user prompt is appended to new AI requests. It is a good "
"place for stable preferences such as “use GDScript 4 style” or “explain "
"risky changes before editing.” Do not put API keys or a request-specific "
"requirement here."
msgstr ""
"常规用户提示词会附加到新的 AI 请求中。这里适合放置稳定偏好，例如“使用 GDScript 4 风格”或“编辑前解释高风险变更”。不要在此放入 "
"API key 或特定请求的要求。"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:74
msgid "Web Search"
msgstr "网页搜索"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:76
msgid ""
"The **Search** page is a separate switch for current-information lookups."
" It does not turn every model into a search model and it does not change "
"the conversation's normal model selection. See :doc:`providers` for the "
"result count, keyword breadth, and billing trade-off."
msgstr ""
"**Search** "
"页面是查询当前信息的独立开关。它不会将每个模型变成搜索模型，也不会改变对话的正常模型选择。有关结果数量、关键词范围和计费取舍，请参阅 "
":doc:`providers`。"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:82
msgid "Archived sessions and import"
msgstr "归档会话和导入"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:84
msgid ""
"Use **Archived sessions** to find, filter, reopen, or remove old "
"conversations. Use **Import** for supported session import flows. Review "
"imported content before continuing it in a write-capable mode; imported "
"prompts and attachments may contain stale paths or assumptions."
msgstr ""
"使用 **Archived sessions** 查找、筛选、重新打开或移除旧对话。支持的会话导入流程使用 "
"**Import**。在可写模式中继续导入的会话前，请审查导入内容；导入的提示词和附件可能包含过期路径或假设。"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:90
msgid "Statistics and About"
msgstr "Statistics 和 About"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:92
msgid ""
"**Statistics** helps you understand usage and context pressure over a "
"selected range. **About** shows application and backend information "
"useful for support and compatibility checks."
msgstr "**Statistics** 帮助你了解选定时间范围内的用量和上下文压力。**About** 显示适合支持和兼容性检查的应用与后端信息。"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:97
msgid "Data reset"
msgstr "重置数据"

#: ../../source/settings/preferences.rst:99
msgid ""
"If you need to reset local application data, first export or back up "
"anything you need and read :doc:`../reference/privacy`. A reset can "
"remove sessions, preferences, or other local state and should not be used"
" as a first response to a single failed run."
msgstr ""
"如果需要重置本地应用数据，请先导出或备份所需内容，并阅读 "
":doc:`../reference/privacy`。重置可能移除会话、偏好或其他本地状态，不应作为单次运行失败时的第一反应。"

